---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Base title="About">
  <section class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-14 px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.4fr]">
    <aside class="md:sticky md:top-24 md:self-start">
      <!-- To add a photo: put it in src/assets and render it here with <Image /> from astro:assets. -->
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-line bg-ink-2 p-8">
        <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -right-20 -top-20 size-64 rounded-full bg-violet/40 blur-3xl"></div>
        <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -bottom-24 -left-16 size-56 rounded-full bg-lime/20 blur-3xl"></div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="grid size-20 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-lime font-display text-3xl font-extrabold text-ink">BV</div>
          <dl class="mt-8 space-y-5">
            <div><dt class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-mute">Based in</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold">{SITE.location}</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-mute">Currently</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold">{SITE.experience[0].role}<br /><span class="font-normal text-paper/70">{SITE.experience[0].org}</span></dd></div>
            <div><dt class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-mute">Focus</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold">ERP, analytics &amp; AI automation</dd></div>
            {SITE.available && <div><dt class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-mute">Status</dt><dd class="mt-1 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-semibold text-lime"><span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-lime"></span>Open to opportunities</dd></div>}
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
    <div>
      <h1 class="font-display text-[clamp(3.5rem,10vw,7rem)] font-extrabold leading-none tracking-[-0.04em]">Hi, I'm {SITE.name.split(' ')[0]}<span class="text-lime">.</span></h1>
      <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-paper/85">
        <p>I'm a business analytics professional who turns operational data into decisions that move financial results. I've worked across technology, e-commerce, and education. My specialties are budgeting metrics, compliance, data mining and mapping, forecasting, and training the people who use these systems every day.</p>
        <p>Today I'm an ERP Functional Analyst at Legends Global Merchandise, running a connected Infor M3, WMS, Shopify, and TMS environment for operations, finance, and IT. Outside work I build AI tooling: agent dashboards, orchestration pipelines, and multi-agent research systems.</p>
        <p>Before that I led a 5-person team migrating 10+ business clients onto Infor M3, and ran outbound fulfillment at Amazon. There I drove $145K+ in savings through Lean Six Sigma work, with 99% accuracy across 17,000+ orders a day. I like problems where messy real-world operations meet systems that need to be reliable. Recent wins include turning a six-figure annual freight loss net-positive and cutting recurring support tickets by 25%.</p>
        <p>I'm a Business Analytics &amp; Information Systems grad from FIU. I'm looking for roles and freelance work that combine systems thinking with hands-on building: ERP and integration work, automation, and putting LLMs into real business workflows.</p>
      </div>
      <h2 class="mt-14 font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-mute">Experience</h2>
      <ol class="mt-6 border-l border-line">
        {SITE.experience.map((e, i) => (
          <li class="relative pb-8 pl-8 last:pb-0">
            <span class:list={['absolute -left-[5px] top-2 size-[9px] rounded-full', i === 0 ? 'bg-lime' : 'bg-line']}></span>
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-mute">{e.when}</p>
            <p class="mt-1 font-display text-xl font-extrabold">{e.role}</p>
            <p class="text-paper/70">{e.org}</p>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
      <h2 class="mt-14 font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-mute">Toolbox</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {SITE.skills.map(s => <li class="rounded-full border border-line bg-ink-2 px-4 py-2 font-mono text-sm">{s}</li>)}
      </ul>
      <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/resume.pdf" class="rounded-full bg-lime px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-ink hover:bg-paper">Download résumé ↓</a>
        <a href="/#contact" class="rounded-full border border-paper/30 px-6 py-3 font-semibold hover:border-lime hover:text-lime">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
